.TH PAINEL-CONTROLE 1 "November 2026" "painel-de-controle 1.1.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
painel-controle \- skeuomorphic control panel for KDE Plasma
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B painel-controle
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B painel-controle
shows a picture of a desktop computer and of a laptop. Clicking a part of the
picture (mouse, keyboard, screen, speakers, network, printer, camera and so on),
or the matching entry in the side list, opens the related KDE Plasma settings
modules with
.BR kcmshell6 (1).
The Webcam entry starts
.BR guvcview (1).
The window is hidden while the settings window is open and comes back when it
is closed.
.PP
.B Advanced Mode
opens the complete System Settings
.RB ( systemsettings (1)).
.PP
The interface follows the language of the Plasma session
.RB ( LANGUAGE ,
.BR LANG ).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B PAINEL_CONTROLE_LOCALEDIR
Additional directory with
.I <lang>/LC_MESSAGES/painel-controle.mo
catalogs, used to run the program from a build tree.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/locale/*/LC_MESSAGES/painel-controle.mo
Translations.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kcmshell6 (1),
.BR systemsettings (1)
